   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Sparkles Text\n\nBold text with four-point stars that twinkle in and out at random spots over the letters, in two colours.\n\nCategory: typography. Length: 5 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A word or short headline should feel magical, premium or celebratory.\n- A title needs a lively glitter without changing the letters themselves.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The mood is serious or minimal.\n- You want sparks flying outward or a burst: use radial-burst or confetti.\n\nVariables:\n- text (string): Text, default \"Shine bright\"\n- font_size (number, 12-280): Font size, default 120\n- color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- color_first (color): Sparkle colour 1, default \"#9E7AFF\"\n- color_second (color): Sparkle colour 2, default \"#FE8BBB\"\n- sparkles_count (number, 1-40): Sparkles, default 10\n- sparkle_size (number, 0.5-4): Sparkle size, default 1.6\n- seed (number, 1-9999): Seed, default 7\n\nSource: https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Sparkles Text\n\n  Bold text with four-point stars that twinkle in and out at random spots over the letters, in two colours.\n\n  Ported to an HTML + GSAP sub-composition by usemosio/blocks from:\n  https://github.com/magicuidesign/magicui/blob/166367b4e31a27f166fd6c2b71d7be290fe0c1bc/apps/www/registry/magicui/sparkles-text.tsx\n  Changes by usemosio/blocks: the stars are drawn from a seeded generator and twinkle for the whole block (the source also moves each star to a new spot after 5 to 15 seconds).\n\n  MIT License\n\n  Copyright (c) Magic UI\n\n  Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy\n  of this software and associated documentation files (the \"Software\"), to deal\n  in the Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights\n  to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell\n  copies of the Software, and to permit persons to whom the Software is\n  furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:\n\n  The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\n  copies or substantial portions of the Software.\n\n  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR\n  IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY,\n  FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE\n  AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER\n  LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM,\n  OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE\n  SOFTWARE.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"sparkles-text\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"5\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n    {\"id\": \"text\", \"type\": \"string\", \"role\": \"content\", \"label\": \"Text\", \"description\": \"The word or phrase the sparkles sit on.\", \"default\": \"Shine bright\"},\n    {\"id\": \"font_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Font size\", \"description\": \"Maximum text size in pixels. Longer text shrinks to fit the frame.\", \"default\": 120, \"min\": 12, \"max\": 280, \"step\": 1, \"unit\": \"px\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Text colour\", \"description\": \"Colour of the letters.\", \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color_first\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Sparkle colour 1\", \"description\": \"First sparkle colour.\", \"default\": \"#9E7AFF\"},\n    {\"id\": \"color_second\", \"type\": \"color\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Sparkle colour 2\", \"description\": \"Second sparkle colour.\", \"default\": \"#FE8BBB\"},\n    {\"id\": \"sparkles_count\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Sparkles\", \"description\": \"How many stars twinkle at once.\", \"default\": 10, \"min\": 1, \"max\": 40, \"step\": 1},\n    {\"id\": \"sparkle_size\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"style\", \"label\": \"Sparkle size\", \"description\": \"Star size relative to the source, which draws 21 px stars beside 60 px text (1 = source).\", \"default\": 1.6, \"min\": 0.5, \"max\": 4, \"step\": 0.1},\n    {\"id\": \"seed\", \"type\": \"number\", \"role\": \"motion\", \"label\": \"Seed\", \"description\": \"Changes where the stars appear.\", \"default\": 7, \"min\": 1, \"max\": 9999, \"step\": 1}\n  ]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Sparkles Text</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@600;700;800&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute;\n          inset: 0;\n          overflow: hidden;\n          container-type: size;\n          pointer-events: none;\n        }\n        .spk-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }\n        .spk-wrap { position: relative; display: inline-block; font-family: var(--font-display, Geist, system-ui, sans-serif); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: pre; }\n        .spk-star { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 20; }\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"sparkles-text\" data-duration=\"5\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"spk-clip\" class=\"spk-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"5\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <span id=\"spk-wrap\" class=\"spk-wrap\"><strong id=\"spk-text\"></strong></span>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/CustomEase.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars =\n              window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables\n                ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables()\n                : {};\n            function num(value, fallback, min, max) {\n              var n = Number(value);\n              return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(max, Math.max(min, n)) : fallback;\n            }\n            function str(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function col(value, fallback) {\n              return typeof value === \"string\" && value ? value : fallback;\n            }\n            function pick(value, options, fallback) {\n              return options.indexOf(String(value)) >= 0 ? String(value) : fallback;\n            }\n            // Shrink an element's font until it fits a share of the frame width.\n            function fit(el, size, share) {\n              el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              var max = Math.max(1, root.clientWidth * share);\n              if (el.scrollWidth > max) {\n                size = Math.max(12, size * (max / el.scrollWidth));\n                el.style.fontSize = size + \"px\";\n              }\n              return size;\n            }\n            // A seeded random generator, so every seek draws the same thing.\n            function mulberry32(a) {\n              return function () {\n                a |= 0; a = (a + 0x6d2b79f5) | 0;\n                var t = Math.imul(a ^ (a >>> 15), 1 | a);\n                t = (t + Math.imul(t ^ (t >>> 7), 61 | t)) ^ t;\n                return ((t ^ (t >>> 14)) >>> 0) / 4294967296;\n              };\n            }\n            function clamp01(x) { return x < 0 ? 0 : x > 1 ? 1 : x; }\n            gsap.registerPlugin(CustomEase);\n            var TAG = \"spk\";\n            var bezN = 0;\n            function bez(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n              return CustomEase.create(TAG + \"-\" + bezN++, \"M0,0 C\" + x1 + \",\" + y1 + \" \" + x2 + \",\" + y2 + \" 1,1\");\n            }\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            function finish() {\n              var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n              if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n              tl.seek(0);\n              window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n              window.__timelines[\"sparkles-text\"] = tl;\n            }\n\n            var wrap = document.getElementById(\"spk-wrap\");\n            var textEl = document.getElementById(\"spk-text\");\n            var c1 = col(vars.color_first, \"#9E7AFF\");\n            var c2 = col(vars.color_second, \"#FE8BBB\");\n            var count = Math.round(num(vars.sparkles_count, 10, 1, 40));\n            textEl.textContent = str(vars.text, \"Shine bright\");\n            wrap.style.color = col(vars.color, \"#0a0a0a\");\n            var size = fit(wrap, num(vars.font_size, 120, 12, 280), 0.9);\n            // The source draws 21 px stars next to 60 px text (text-6xl); keep that ratio.\n            var starPx = (21 * size) / 60 * num(vars.sparkle_size, 1.6, 0.5, 4);\n            var rnd = mulberry32(Math.round(num(vars.seed, 7, 1, 9999)));\n            var SPARK = \"M9.82531 0.843845C10.0553 0.215178 10.9446 0.215178 11.1746 0.843845L11.8618 2.72026C12.4006 4.19229 12.3916 6.39157 13.5 7.5C14.6084 8.60843 16.8077 8.59935 18.2797 9.13822L20.1561 9.82534C20.7858 10.0553 20.7858 10.9447 20.1561 11.1747L18.2797 11.8618C16.8077 12.4007 14.6084 12.3916 13.5 13.5C12.3916 14.6084 12.4006 16.8077 11.8618 18.2798L11.1746 20.1562C10.9446 20.7858 10.0553 20.7858 9.82531 20.1562L9.13819 18.2798C8.59932 16.8077 8.60843 14.6084 7.5 13.5C6.39157 12.3916 4.19225 12.4007 2.72023 11.8618L0.843814 11.1747C0.215148 10.9447 0.215148 10.0553 0.843814 9.82534L2.72023 9.13822C4.19225 8.59935 6.39157 8.60843 7.5 7.5C8.60843 6.39157 8.59932 4.19229 9.13819 2.72026L9.82531 0.843845Z\";\n            var NS = \"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\";\n            var stars = [];\n            for (var i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n              var s = { x: rnd() * 100, y: rnd() * 100, color: rnd() > 0.5 ? c1 : c2, delay: rnd() * 2, scale: rnd() * 1 + 0.3 };\n              rnd(); // lifespan in the source\n              var svg = document.createElementNS(NS, \"svg\");\n              svg.setAttribute(\"viewBox\", \"0 0 21 21\");\n              svg.setAttribute(\"width\", starPx);\n              svg.setAttribute(\"height\", starPx);\n              svg.setAttribute(\"class\", \"spk-star\");\n              svg.id = \"spk-star-\" + i;\n              svg.style.left = s.x + \"%\";\n              svg.style.top = s.y + \"%\";\n              var p = document.createElementNS(NS, \"path\");\n              p.setAttribute(\"d\", SPARK);\n              p.setAttribute(\"fill\", s.color);\n              svg.appendChild(p);\n              wrap.appendChild(svg);\n              s.el = svg;\n              stars.push(s);\n            }\n            // Source: opacity [0,1,0], scale [0,s,0], rotate [75,120,150] over 0.8 s, repeating, ease-in-out per half.\n            var inOut = bez(0.42, 0, 0.58, 1);\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"5\");\n            var clock = { t: 0 };\n            function draw(t) {\n              stars.forEach(function (s) {\n                var u = t - s.delay;\n                if (u < 0) { s.el.style.opacity = 0; return; }\n                u = (u % 0.8) / 0.8;\n                var first = u < 0.5;\n                var h = inOut(first ? u / 0.5 : (u - 0.5) / 0.5);\n                var op = first ? h : 1 - h;\n                var sc = s.scale * op;\n                var rot = first ? 75 + 45 * h : 120 + 30 * h;\n                s.el.style.opacity = op.toFixed(3);\n                s.el.style.transform = \"rotate(\" + rot.toFixed(2) + \"deg) scale(\" + sc.toFixed(3) + \")\";\n              });\n            }\n            tl.to(clock, { t: total, duration: total, ease: \"none\", onUpdate: function () { draw(clock.t); } }, 0);\n            draw(0);\n\n            finish();\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
 "sha256": "06ff4065bd78e23744e9502ca13bfe054d33f9eecdafed068907c4746a526207",
